# Keep shell scripts LF whatever the platform sets. Git for Windows
# defaults to core.autocrlf=true, which rewrote entrypoint.sh with CRLF in
# the working tree; the image is built from there, so the container died on
# every start with "exec /app/entrypoint.sh: no such file or directory" —
# the kernel reading the shebang as /bin/sh\r (issue #276).
* text=auto
*.sh text eol=lf
entrypoint.sh text eol=lf
